    ("What is negligence in tort law?", "Negligence is the failure to exercise reasonable care, resulting in harm to another person."),
    ("What is the statute of limitations?", "The statute of limitations is the maximum time period allowed to initiate legal proceedings after an event occurs."),
    ("What is intellectual property?", "Intellectual property refers to legal rights over creations of the mind, including patents, trademarks, and copyrights."),
    ("What is the purpose of a will?", "A will is a legal document that specifies how a person's assets should be distributed after their death."),
    ("What is habeas corpus?", "Habeas corpus is a legal principle that protects individuals from unlawful detention by requiring justification before a court."),
