    ("What is breach of contract?", "A breach of contract occurs when one party fails to fulfill their obligations under the agreement without lawful excuse."),
    ("What is the role of precedent in common law?", "Precedent, or stare decisis, requires courts to follow rulings from prior similar cases to ensure consistency in the law."),
