    ("What is defamation?", "Defamation is a false statement presented as fact that harms a person's reputation, divided into libel and slander."),
    ("What is the purpose of a non-disclosure agreement?", "An NDA legally binds parties to keep specified information confidential and not disclose it to third parties."),
    ("What is jurisdiction?", "Jurisdiction is the official authority of a court to hear and decide legal cases within a defined geographic or subject-matter scope."),
